  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "Let's review the scene step by step.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Доброе утро, Дмитрий Владимирович.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Good morning, Dmitry Vladimirovich.' -- Vika greets the restaurant owner very politely.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "nagiev",
   "t": "Пожалуй, добрый день, Вика.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'I would say it is afternoon, Vika.' -- He corrects her about the current time.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "nagiev",
   "t": "Почему, Вик, на выставку не улетели?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Why didn't you fly out to the exhibition?' -- He asks about her cancelled business trip.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Так ее же отменили.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'It was cancelled. I called my contacts.' -- She repeats the fake story to him.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Я звонила своим друзьям.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Some businessman called you, right?' -- Nagiev asks for details about the call.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "nagiev",
   "t": "Вам же звонил там какой-то предприниматель.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Who? Yeah, he called.' -- Vika nervously confirms the fake conversation.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Какой?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Let's see. Alexander Del Piero.' -- He reads the fake Italian name aloud.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Да, звонил.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'He said the exhibition was cancelled.' -- She desperately tries to maintain the lie.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "nagiev",
   "t": "Сейчас скажем.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Was it a call from a Moscow number?' -- He catches her in a geographical lie.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "nagiev",
   "t": "Александр Дель Пьеро.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Yeah, here is the number. Call it.' -- He challenges her to verify the caller.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Сказал, что выставка отменяется.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Dmitry Vladimirovich. I hope you know what you're doing, Vik.' -- He expresses his deep disappointment in her.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "nagiev",
   "t": "С московского телефона звонят?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'If you hadn't done so much for our restaurant...' -- He reminds her of her past value.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "nagiev",
   "t": "Да, вот номер.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'I would have fired you. As it is...' -- He reveals his true anger at her. Now let's listen to the conversation without interruption.",
